hared component seems to handle both.\n\nMaybe the bug is in completed quest rows: the quest log's completed rows might be missing the progress bar or reward, or the \"Reset\" button overlapping, or wrong text. Let me carefully inspect a completed row visually. From earlier screenshot of Gathering, completed rows showed title, desc, \"Completed\" (with icon), and Reset button. Is \"Reset\" expected? Probably reset the quest to repeat for XP? Maybe.\n\nPotential bug in quest log: Completed quests should show reward claim? Perhaps \"Completed\" rows also should show a \"Claim\" button? Hmm.\n\nLet's check the Journal for quest log. Go Home then Journal."}
