t include the reward slot. The quest board rows also don't show reward though. The shared component may have a \"reward\" section only visible in the board? Hmm.\n\nLet's inspect a completed quest row's \"Reset\" button behavior. Maybe tapping \"Reset\" is bugged: it could reset the quest but not update the row (still shows Completed), or reset wrong quest, or not reset progress. Testing this would be valuable. Let's tap Reset on Fishing I (completed) and observe.\n\nBut this changes data: Fishing I becomes incomplete. We can then maybe complete? not easily. But QA testing allows. The reset might be the expected action to redo the quest; user might want to. If bug, we report.\n\nLet's do it. Go Quests → Gathering. Currently on shop buy. Navigate Home→Quests. Bottom nav coordinates. Use tap x=760,y=2169 then wait."}
